<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <meta name="version" content="LS-excerpt-2"/>
  <title>HTML Living Standard Excerpt</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/"/>
</head>
<body>
  <header><p>WHATWG Living Standard — offline corpus excerpt</p></header>
  <nav id="toc"><ul><li>Networking</li></ul></nav>
  <h1>HTML (WHATWG-style corpus excerpt)</h1>
  <h2 id="networking">Networking</h2>
  <p id="w1">User agents must close idle sockets after 30 seconds.</p>
  <p id="w2">Authors must provide alternative text for images.</p>
  <div class="example">
    <p>Example: the element must have a src attribute in this illustration.</p>
  </div>
  <pre><code>&lt;img src=x&gt; <!-- must ignore --></code></pre>
  <h2 id="forms">Forms</h2>
  <p id="w3">Implementations may cache form validation results.</p>
  <p id="w4">User agents must not submit forms with invalid required controls.</p>
</body>
</html>
